@startuml 04_PackagingParameterUpdatedInfo
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

skinparam sequence {
ArrowColor #8A0808
LifeLineBorderColor #8A0808

ParticipantBorderColor #8A0808
ParticipantBackgroundColor #585858
ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
}

skinparam note {
borderColor #000000
backgroundColor #E6E6E6
}

participant "**LOL**" as DZ order 1
participant "**LEA Service**" as Service order 2

note over Service
LogisticsInteraction
--
LogisticsQuestionID[-1]: No question
LogisticsQuestionID[4]: PackagingParameterUpdatedInfo
..
LogisticsAnswerID[-2]: Error
LogisticsAnswerID[-1]: No answer
LogisticsAnswerID[1]: Acknowledgement
..
LogisticsQuestionParam1: ' '
LogisticsQuestionParam2: ' '
end note

DZ <<- Service: LogisticsQuestionID: 4\nLogisticsQuestionParam1: 'B' (Array index)\nLogisticsQuestionParam2: ' ' (not used)

hnote over DZ
Check whether the modified parameter set
at array index B should be adopted
in the LOL parameter management
end hnote

hnote over DZ
If necessary, adopt the parameter set
end hnote

DZ ->> Service: LogisticsAnswerID := 1 (Acknowledgement)

hnote over Service
The LOL has received the information
about the parameter set change
end hnote

DZ <<- Service: LogisticsQuestionID := -1\nLogisticsQuestionParam1 := ' '\nLogisticsQuestionParam2 := ' '
DZ ->> Service: LogisticsAnswerID := -1

@enduml
